{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "gi",
  "id": "an-ode-to-khvarena",
  "name": "An Ode to Khvarena",
  "sourceUrl": "https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/An_Ode_to_Khvarena",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-21T09:24:40.108Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "O Nagarjuna,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Aided by Khvarena in its countless forms, I bless this land of eternal calamity."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When the sludge of the deepest depths of the abyss stained the first kingdom,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The glorious Khvarena that aided the Lord of Wisdom was scattered in endless forms."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I crossed back over the River of Sorrow, and of the Amrita I drank."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I opened a path for the benevolent spirits so that the merciful light of wisdom may illuminate the four corners."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-754b446916fa784a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "O Nagarjuna,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Aided by Khvarena in its countless forms, I nourish the benevolent spirits in the sea of flowers."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Behold, soul illuminated by Khvarena, final descendant of the god of grass and trees."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Behold, heroes who battle the cataclysm endlessly, foes of the Dev."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For not even the inky gloom from beyond the skies shall erode their forms."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6ed6f5523233fec5"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "O Nagarjuna,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Aided by Khvarena in its countless forms, I have transcended the dead of this foul earth."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Cleanse the sinless of their sins, so that they may be reborn in a pure land free of suffering."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In the chakras of the earth are contained the karmic seeds that will give birth to all things."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The fleeting blights and glories of the earthly realm are naught but the illusion of existing seeds."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fd4c00f1067dedb7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "O Nagarjuna,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Aided by Khvarena in its countless forms, I have cleansed the abyss of heaven above."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The sludge welling up from the depths of the abyss has finally receded,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The legacy of Dahri, too, has submitted to the law."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A thousand songs were sung in unison, and the heavy rains abated for a time."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7eb14c48395522e7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "O Nagarjuna,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If the dark tide reappears and the black abyss returns,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sing this hymn and offer prayers to the Khvarena unassailable."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "May the eternal Khvarena guide us on the upward path."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-49969062f6232f89"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
